      "simplified": "7月14日晚上在法国尼斯发生的恐怖袭击事件让法国人民及世界人民悲痛万分，",
      "traditional": "7月14日晚上在法國尼斯發生的恐怖襲擊事件讓法國人民及世界人民悲痛萬分，",
      "pinyin": "1 yuè 2 rì wǎn shang zài fǎ guó ní sī fā shēng de kǒng bù xí jī shì jiàn ràng fǎ guó rén mín jí shì jiè rén mín bēi tòng wàn fēn",
      "english": "We still have a long way to go for world peace."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "对全球的反恐势力也是一记沉重的打击。",
      "traditional": "對全球的反恐勢力也是一記沉重的打擊。",
      "pinyin": "duì quán qiú de fǎn kǒng shì li yě shì yí jì chén zhòng de dǎ jī",
      "english": "The terrorist attack that happened at midnight the 14th of July in Nice France grieved the French people and others all over the world."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "法国自去年11月巴黎恐怖袭击发生后，便宣称全国进入紧急状态。",
      "traditional": "法國自去年11月巴黎恐怖襲擊發生後，便宣稱全國進入緊急狀態。",
      "pinyin": "fǎ guó zì qù nián 2 yuè bā lí kǒng bù xí jī fā shēng hòu biàn xuān chēng quán guó jìn rù jǐn jí zhuàng tài",
      "english": "It also swung a heavy blow to global anti-terrorism."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "但讽刺的是，当局原定7月26日取消这一状态，",
      "traditional": "但諷刺的是，當局原定7月26日取消這一狀態，",
      "pinyin": "dàn fěng cì de shì dāng jú yuán dìng 1 yuè 3 rì qǔ xiāo zhè yí zhuàng tài",
      "english": "Since the Paris terrorist attack in November 2015, the French government has proclaimed the country being under a state of emergency."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "谁料一波未平，一波又起。",
      "traditional": "誰料一波未平，一波又起。",
      "pinyin": "shéi liào yì bō wèi píng yì bō yòu qǐ",
      "english": "Ironically, the government was actually planning to remove the state of emergency on 26th July."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "恐怖袭击破坏力极强的伤害性和突发性让所有人对其恨之入骨，",
      "traditional": "恐怖襲擊破壞力極強的傷害性和突發性讓所有人對其恨之入骨，",
      "pinyin": "kǒng bù xí jī pò huài lì jí qiáng de shāng hài xìng hé tū fā xìng ràng suǒ yǒu rén duì qí hèn zhī rù gǔ",
      "english": "Who would expect such a terrible tragedy when the previous wound was not even healed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "但又无可奈何。",
      "traditional": "但又無可奈何。",
      "pinyin": "dàn yòu wú kě nài hé",
      "english": "The massive harm and unpredictability of such terrorist attacks makes the public despise these sorts of actions."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "这种敌暗我明的态势对任何一个政府来说都是万分棘手的。",
      "traditional": "這種敵暗我明的態勢對任何一個政府來說都是萬分棘手的。",
      "pinyin": "zhè zhǒng dí àn wǒ míng de tài shì duì rèn hé yí ge zhèng fǔ lái shuō dōu shì wàn fēn jí shǒu de",
      "english": "There is however very little they can do about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Enemies hiding in the dark have proven to be very difficult for governments to handle."
    }
