    "sentence_translations": [
      "When will the Violence Stop?",
      "",
      "We still have a long way to go for world peace.",
      "The terrorist attack that happened at midnight the 14th of July in Nice France grieved the French people and others all over the world.",
      "It also swung a heavy blow to global anti-terrorism.",
      "Since the Paris terrorist attack in November 2015, the French government has proclaimed the country being under a state of emergency.",
      "Ironically, the government was actually planning to remove the state of emergency on 26th July.",
      "Who would expect such a terrible tragedy when the previous wound was not even healed?",
      "The massive harm and unpredictability of such terrorist attacks makes the public despise these sorts of actions.",
      "There is however very little they can do about it.",
      "Enemies hiding in the dark have proven to be very difficult for governments to handle.",
